review_comments.body:
This method is used by tests only, and I bet the test cases could be modified to avoid using `pattern` ... and then we could simplify this class :)
```java
@FunctionalInterface
public interface ClientMatchPattern {

    boolean matches(String input);

    static ClientMatchPattern ofRe2(com.google.re2j.Pattern pattern) {
        return input -> pattern.matcher(input).matches();
    }

    @Deprecated(since = "4.x", forRemoval = true)
    static ClientMatchPattern ofLegacy(java.util.regex.Pattern pattern) {
        return input -> pattern.matcher(input).matches();
    }
}
```

